msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:21 e8a290c1c64148a49220fdbb4c182ba9
msgid ""
"Runtime mixing bus backed by an FMOD channel group. :ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` owns "
"buses for the active :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`; obtain them with "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_audio_bus()<class_FmodServer_method_get_audio_bus>` or "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_audio_bus_by_id()<class_FmodServer_method_get_audio_bus_by_id>`. The server "
"manages their lifetime."
msgstr ""
"由 FMOD 通道组支持的运行时混音总线。:ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` 管理当前 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` 的总线，通过 "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_audio_bus()<class_FmodServer_method_get_audio_bus>` 或 "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_audio_bus_by_id()<class_FmodServer_method_get_audio_bus_by_id>` "
"获取，生命周期由服务器管理。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:23 e846b09b408945678c37fb80bbecd84d
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` to author routing, mixing state, and "
"effect slots. Direct changes to this runtime object do not modify or save the layout. Managed "
"effect instances are per slot; "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` "
"provides access by stable IDs."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` "
"编辑路由、混音状态和效果器槽位。直接修改运行时对象不会修改或保存布局。每个受管槽位都有独立运行实例，可通过 "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` 按稳定 "
"ID 获取。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:25 087167f2cf0d4928b07e49dfb75559b8
msgid ""
"Standalone buses created with :ref:`init_bus()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_init_bus>` remain "
"available for low-level routing. Their lifetime and effects are managed by the caller."
msgstr ""
"通过 :ref:`FmodAudioBus.init_bus()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_init_bus>` "
"创建的独立总线可用于低层路由，其生命周期和效果器由调用方管理。"

