"Returns the parent stored by :ref:`init_bus()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_init_bus>` or "
":ref:`set_parent()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_set_parent>`. To inspect routing changed directly "
"through the channel group, use "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup.get_parent_group()<class_FmodChannelGroup_method_get_parent_group>` on "
":ref:`get_bus()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_get_bus>`."
msgstr ""
"返回 :ref:`FmodAudioBus.init_bus()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_init_bus>` 或 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBus.set_parent()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_set_parent>` 保存的父通道组。检查直接通过通道组修改的路由时，对 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBus.get_bus()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_get_bus>` 返回的对象调用 "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup.get_parent_group()<class_FmodChannelGroup_method_get_parent_group>`。"

