#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:247 2b8c06fbb94a4022afb5b9989eb73b93
msgid ""
"Removes this bus's effects and clears its channel-group references. Releases the native channel "
"group for buses other than ``Master``. Call this only for standalone buses whose lifetime you "
"manage; the server releases buses obtained through :ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>`."
msgstr ""
"移除总线效果器并清空通道组引用。对于 ``Master`` 以外的总线，还会释放原生通道组。仅对自行管理生命周期的独立总线调用此方法；通过 "
":ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` 获取的总线由服务器释放。"

