#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:337 fdb1ff46662a48c8b22183fb69811824
msgid ""
"Stores the user mute flag. Call :ref:`apply_mute()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_apply_mute>` to "
"apply it, or use "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_mute()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_mute>` to update "
"muting across the layout."
msgstr ""
"保存用户静音标志。调用  :ref:`apply_mute()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_apply_mute>`  应用，或使用  "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_mute()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_mute>`  "
"更新布局中的静音状态。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:349 aa5a308e665f4397aea3d49876868da3
msgid "Returns the stored user mute flag. A bus can also be muted by another bus's solo state."
msgstr "返回保存的用户静音标志。其他总线的独奏状态也可能使此总线静音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:359 86a97e52fdd0445596f0d93f5e6fff0d
msgid "|void| **apply_mute**\\ (\\ mute\\: :ref:`bool<class_bool>`\\ )"
msgstr "|void| **apply_mute**\\ (\\ mute\\: :ref:`bool<class_bool>`\\ )"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:361 0d6dc56ae1874483a56b4dd7d60be19c
msgid ""
"Applies the stored mute flag and solo state to the channel group. The ``mute`` argument means "
"that any bus in the layout is soloed; this bus is muted when that argument is ``true`` and its "
"own solo flag is ``false``."
msgstr "将保存的静音标志和独奏状态应用到通道组。\\  ``mute``  参数表示布局中存在独奏总线；此参数为  ``true``  且当前总线未独奏时，当前总线会被静音。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:373 ab19e1d4bde745d594137f2e8ad76ff5
msgid ""
"Stores the solo flag. Use "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_solo>` to also "
"recompute muting across the layout."
msgstr ""
"保存独奏标志。使用  :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_solo>`"
"  可同时重新计算布局中的静音状态。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:385 17545a2b5a06459395561c2c811c2d75
msgid ""
"Returns the stored solo flag, independently of the user mute flag. Use "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_solo>` to apply "
"solo muting across the layout."
msgstr ""
"返回保存的独奏标志，不受用户静音标志影响。可通过  "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_solo>`  "
"将独奏静音状态应用到整个布局。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:397 412a1f78220c4eb1a09b170777e8387d
msgid ""
"Stores the runtime bypass flag. Call :ref:`sync_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_sync_bypass>` "
"to apply it to this bus's effect instances. For layout-managed slots, use "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_bypass>` so "
"slot enable flags are also respected."
msgstr ""
"保存运行时旁路标记，调用 :ref:`FmodAudioBus.sync_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_sync_bypass>` "
"后应用到总线效果器实例。对于布局管理的槽位，使用 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_bypass>`，以同时遵循槽位启用状态。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:409 9ba70e5ef2d54c9e93343e0acff32c1b
msgid ""
"Returns the stored runtime bypass flag. "
":ref:`sync_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_sync_bypass>` applies it to this bus's effect "
"instances."
msgstr ""
"返回保存的运行时旁路标记。:ref:`FmodAudioBus.sync_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBus_method_sync_bypass>` "
"将其应用到总线效果器实例。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:419 4aa2da98c2824e81884c8d5e10d3d854
msgid "|void| **sync_bypass**\\ (\\ )"
msgstr "|void| **sync_bypass**\\ (\\ )"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiobus.rst:421 90655c352665482d8d50415eeadca18d
msgid ""
"Applies the stored bypass flag to the DSP chains of this bus's stored effect instances. The "
"channel-group fader and DSPs added separately through low-level APIs are unchanged. Use "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_bypass>` to "
"combine bus bypass with each managed slot's enabled state."
msgstr ""
"将保存的旁路标记应用到总线所保存效果器实例的 DSP 链。通道组音量推子及通过低层 API 单独添加的 DSP 保持原状。通过 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_bypass()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_set_bus_bypass>` "
"同时处理总线旁路与受管槽位的启用状态。"
